          "explanation": "Doctor asks family to check discharge summary, CT report, and medication bags to clarify whether surgery occurred or was only recommended.",
          "quote": "请你直接帮我核对两样最关键的文字：1）把出院小结上“出院诊断”“出院医嘱/出院后用药”几行逐字读给我；2）把胰岛素那一行如果在处方/小结上写了，也逐字读给我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor addresses decision-critical information gaps by asking the family to read the discharge summary, CT report, and medication bags, uses workspace records to reconcile diagnosis and surgical recommendation, and integrates clarified information into the triage and follow-up plan.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "Doctor identifies newly diagnosed type 2 diabetes treated with mealtime insulin, basal insulin, and acarbose, and sets safe boundaries around eating less, missed meals, and hypoglycemia.",
          "quote": "门冬属于餐时胰岛素，默认是跟这顿饭量相关的。如果这顿明显少吃、吃不下，或者准备不吃，这个餐前针不能像平时一样机械照打"
