        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledges uncertainty where records or exam are unavailable, uses conditional language for surgery timing and medication adjustment, directs definitive decisions to hepatobiliary surgery or appropriate offline clinicians, and does not hallucinate hidden details or convert discharge medicines into curative gallstone treatment.",
